b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲
  c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ HARNESS POSING incremental;
  c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ PROVENANCE author: harness-algol-60 (qualification program for a made-up problem, not a result);
  c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ PROVENANCE precursor seen: no;
  c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ PROVENANCE idioms: the Revised Report (1962), the X1 system's read, print, PRINTTEXT and NLCR;
  c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ X03 (made up), in the X1 form. U: u = 1 + ... + n. V: v = n times n. No constants;
  i̲n̲t̲e̲g̲e̲r̲ n, cap, m, i, code, k, c, s, j;
  n := read; cap := read; m := read;
  f̲o̲r̲ i := 1 s̲t̲e̲p̲ 1 u̲n̲t̲i̲l̲ m d̲o̲ code := read;
  f̲o̲r̲ i := 1 w̲h̲i̲l̲e̲ t̲r̲u̲e̲ d̲o̲
  b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲
    code := read; k := read; c := read;
    i̲f̲ c = 1 t̲h̲e̲n̲
    b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲ s := 0; f̲o̲r̲ j := 1 s̲t̲e̲p̲ 1 u̲n̲t̲i̲l̲ n d̲o̲ s := s + j;
      PRINTTEXT(`[answer]u = '); print(s); PRINTTEXT(`[/answer]') e̲n̲d̲
    e̲l̲s̲e̲ i̲f̲ c = 2 t̲h̲e̲n̲
    b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲ PRINTTEXT(`[answer]v = '); print(n × n); PRINTTEXT(`[/answer]') e̲n̲d̲;
    NLCR; PRINTTEXT(`[end]')
  e̲n̲d̲
e̲n̲d̲
